@@ -43,6 +43,25 @@ Use KernelWiki from this repository's pinned submodule. A direct upstream
 checkout may contain artifact snapshots governed by additional terms that are
 omitted from this distribution.
 
+### Optional project-level external skills
+
+A downstream project can prepare a skill in its own workspace and load it into
+this KDA checkout without installing anything under the user's home directory:
+
+```bash
+python3 tools/load_external_skill.py --source /absolute/path/to/prepared-skill --name my-skill
+python3 tools/load_external_skill.py --source /absolute/path/to/prepared-skill --name my-skill --check
+```
+
+The loader copies the prepared skill to the local `.claude/skills/my-skill`
+directory, verifies every copied file by SHA256, and skips Git metadata. This
+generated directory is ignored by Git so external assets are not staged. A
+later update requires `--replace` and only works for a copy previously made by
+this loader. Existing links and unmanaged directories are never replaced. The
+external skill's source, license review, build, and domain tests remain the
+downstream project's responsibility; KDA's pinned `skills/KernelWiki` submodule
+is unchanged.
+
 ## Submodules
 
 The following third-party projects are included as Git submodules. The source URLs and revisions below are intentional and match the gitlinks recorded in this repository.
